{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261024/photo/bkn-20261024072030173-1024_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261024111101\"/><p>今日(24日)凌晨4時39分，執法部門接報指屯門安定邨定泰樓一單位，一名9歲女童情緒激動，持刀揮舞，父親見狀立即搶刀，混亂中，女童被刀鎅傷，胸口受傷流血。救援人員接報到場，將清醒女童送往屯門醫院救治。警員經調查後，以涉嫌「傷人」罪拘捕父親。事件經過及原因，有待進一步調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T03:24:17.390064+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T23:20:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:38:15.578308+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T03:18:33.168421+00:00","content_hash":"9c0a3e150563ab0d898c16d1b873da9d404b67d7b61e846e19306cfe9899046f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T03:24:17.390064+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}